<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53869" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδεής</span></b> (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδέω</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wanting in, lacking</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρημάτων κ. ἀγγήϊα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́</span>: abs., of persons,
				<i>needy</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδεής</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				10.36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τάφος</span> a <i>sorry,
				shabby</i> burial, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				719e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὴν ἡλικίαν</span>
			<i>under</i> age, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				54.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more freq. in 
				Comp.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδεέστερος</span>
			<i>weaker, inferior</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδεέστερός τινος τῷ
				τάχει, πρὸς τὸ φρονεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.Prooem.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δεῶς</span>, mostly in 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδεέστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					5.84
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				6.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τέρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					12.37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τέρως ἔχειν περί τι</span> to
			be <i>very ill off</i> in a thing, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				48.55
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀντιδίκων -τέρως ἔχειν πρὸς τὸ
					λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.Al.</u>
					1442a16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
